<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Analog Devices raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Analog Devices raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it upgraded Analog Devices Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said industry fundamentals are improving for the analog sector. Said certain trends are improving and will result in stronger order patterns, improved lead times and better visibility for the analog group and Analog Devices, in particular.</p>
<p>-- set a nine-month price target of $29 a share.</p>
<p>-- Analog Devices gained 7/8 to 24.</p>
</text>
